  "articleBody": "Before requesting a kitchen layout redesign proposal, document the room’s dimensions, utility locations, storage problems, appliance sizes, and the way your household uses the space. Then ask the provider to show more than one workable plan, identify changes that may affect permits or construction, separate allowances from selections, and explain how design decisions become an approved building plan.",
